  "term_and_condition": "<p>Welcome to BE THE ENVY!</p>\n<p>Thanks for joining our Affiliate program.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Be The Envy, LLC Affiliate Agreement</b></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">This Affiliate Agreement (\"Agreement\") is entered into by and between Be The Envy, LLC, a Florida limited liability company (\"Company\"), and the individual or entity applying to become an Affiliate (\"Affiliate\" or \"Affiliate Partner\"). By participating in the Company’s affiliate program (\"Program\"), the Affiliate agrees to the following terms and conditions:<br><br>We reserve the right to approve or reject ANY Affiliate Program Registration in our sole and absolute discretion. You will have no legal recourse against us for the rejection of your Affiliate Program Registration.<br><br>An Affiliate link is automatically generated, but you can also generate an affiliate link for a specific product or collection. If a person clicks on someone else’s referral link and then later clicks on yours, yours is the one that counts.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">Affiliates may or may not be assigned a specific coupon code, with details and usage clarified on the <b>Dashboard</b>. If a customer clicks on both the affiliate link and uses the coupon code, you will not receive double commission. If you’re not assigned a branded coupon, then you’re not allowed to promote it.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">Affiliates may also advertise merchant websites on online channels such as Facebook, Instagram, or offline classified ads in magazines and newspapers.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"> </p>\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0in;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><hr align=\"center\" width=\"96%\" size=\"0\"></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>1. Definitions</b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Company</b>: Be The Envy, LLC, including its products, services, and intellectual property.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Affiliate / Affiliate Partner</b>: An independent contractor or business entity promoting Company products in exchange for commission-based compensation.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Promotion</b>: Any marketing, advertising, or communication method used by the Affiliate to drive traffic or sales to the Company’s website or platforms.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Commission</b>: The financial reward earned by the Affiliate based on qualifying Sales.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Sales</b>: Completed purchases of Company products by customers referred by the Affiliate via a unique tracking link or code.</li>\n</ul>\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0in;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><hr align=\"center\" width=\"96%\" size=\"0\"></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>2. Term and Termination</b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">This Agreement begins on the date of acceptance into the Program and will continue unless terminated by either party.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">Either party may terminate this Agreement at any time, with or without cause, by providing written notice.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">The Company may terminate the Agreement immediately for cause, including but not limited to: breach of contract, illegal activity, or non-compliance with this Agreement.</li>\n</ul>\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0in;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><hr align=\"center\" width=\"93%\" size=\"0\"></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>3. Responsibilities</b> <b>Affiliate Responsibilities:</b></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">Promote Company products using approved marketing materials.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">Abide by all advertising guidelines and applicable laws.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">Avoid false or misleading claims about the Company or its products.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\">Refrain from spamming or unethical promoti